OL,3,CHomes and streets flooded after
OL,4,Creports of 'blast' at nearby quarry
OL,6,FHomes in a village on the outskirts of
OL,7,FCardiff have been flooded and
OL,8,Femergency services are advising people
OL,9,Fto avoid the area.
OL,11,FThe incident happened in Gwaelod-y-
OL,12,FGarth, in the Taff's Well area and
OL,13,Flocals say this happened minutes after
OL,14,Fa "blast" at a nearby quarry. The
OL,15,Froads affected are near a quarry site
OL,16,Fowned by Breedon.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/3
