OL,3,CHomes and streets flooded after
OL,4,Creports of 'blast' at nearby quarry
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the company said:
OL,7,F"We are aware of an incident that took
OL,8,Fplace at our Taffs Well Quarry this
OL,9,Fafternoon. Our teams are working
OL,10,Fclosely with the relevant authorities
OL,11,Fwhile engaging with the local
OL,12,Fcommunity as we respond to the
OL,13,Fsituation.
OL,15,F"Our priority is supporting the
OL,16,Fresponse, and we are not in a position
OL,17,Fto provide any further comment at this
OL,18,Ftime."
OL,20,FThe police and South Wales Fire &
OL,21,FRescue are currently at the scene.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
