OL,3,CHomes and streets flooded after
OL,4,Creports of 'blast' at nearby quarry
OL,6,FIn a statement on social media, the
OL,7,Ffire service said: "We are currently
OL,8,Fresponding to surface water flooding
OL,9,Fat Heol Berry and Heol Y Nant, Gwaelod-
OL,10,Fy-Garth, in the Taff's Well area.
OL,12,F"Please avoid the area to allow the
OL,13,Femergency services to deal with the
OL,14,Fincident."
OL,16,FSouth Wales Police said: "A road
OL,17,Fclosure is in place at the junction of
OL,18,FHeol Goch and Main Road. Please avoid
OL,19,Fthe area to allow the emergency
OL,20,Fservices to deal with the incident"
